<title>USA: U.S. mortgage application volume fell in latest wk.</title>
<headline>U.S. mortgage application volume fell in latest wk.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-12-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>The volume of U.S. mortgage applications fell 14.3 percent in the week ended December 13, according to a Mortgage Bankers Association of America weekly survey.</p>
<p>Specifically, the volume of applications to refinance mortgages fell 22.2 percent in the latest survey week, while applications to purchase mortgages dropped 9.3 percent.</p>
<p>The seasonally adjusted refinancing index slipped 22.2 percent to 475.4 from 610.7 the previous week.</p>
<p>The purchase index fell 6.6 percent to 204.7 in the latest survey from 219.2 in the previous week.  </p>
